{
  "title": "Brazilian Chicken Skewers",
  "description": "A show-off Brazilian dish featuring ginger cordial and pickle, with a nutty and crunchy texture, this recipe is perfect for those looking for a FODMAP-friendly meal option.",
  "cuisine": "Brazilian",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
